#created by Duel Circuit - Chaos / Yata-Lock (2004)
#era 2004
#tier Historic oppressive strategy
#about Chaos Emperor Dragon – Envoy of the End, Sangan/Witch and Yata-Garasu could wipe resources and deny future draws; Chaos builds also used Black Luster Soldier – Envoy of the Beginning.
#why A foundational example of why the Forbidden List was necessary. "Yata-Lock" describes a particular lock sequence, not every Chaos deck.
#source Format Library deck 3432 (https://www.formatlibrary.com/decks/3432): Chaos Control, 1st at BCAMS04 (Chaos format, 2004-08-28)
#originals Original card versions (pre-errata / Goat format) as played in its era.
